WEBVTT

01:35.740 --> 01:38.780
The Furutama Projects, Sector 1.

01:38.780 --> 01:43.410
Here in this dark industrial zone created by Omura Industries,

01:43.410 --> 01:46.790
there is neither hope nor welfare.

01:57.380 --> 01:59.510
Nancy to José-san.

01:59.510 --> 02:02.470
We're clear. Proceeding to the next phase. Over.

02:03.010 --> 02:05.930
Stop joking around, Nancy-san.

02:05.930 --> 02:07.980
You can't keep pretending to be a spy.

02:07.980 --> 02:10.020
Like I keep saying, if you screw up—

02:10.020 --> 02:12.110
I'm grateful for your help.

02:12.110 --> 02:13.020
Really, I am.

02:16.030 --> 02:17.490
Building 14, right?

02:17.490 --> 02:19.410
Yeah, sixth floor.

02:19.410 --> 02:23.700
It's hard to believe he'd end up in a dump like this, though.

02:26.830 --> 02:33.250
PAIN OF SERPENT

02:38.510 --> 02:40.590
Room 606, right?

02:41.760 --> 02:42.930
José-san?

02:44.640 --> 02:45.770
It's open?

02:53.230 --> 02:55.360
TANUKI

02:55.360 --> 02:56.610
No way!

02:59.400 --> 03:01.860
José-san! Bad news! Taragi is—

03:01.860 --> 03:03.120
CHOMP!

03:13.880 --> 03:16.050
You little rat.

03:22.470 --> 03:24.100
You can't move now, can you?

03:27.270 --> 03:29.600
That's what this poison does.

03:29.600 --> 03:31.520
RETURN!

03:33.060 --> 03:35.690
DŌMO, Nancy Lee-SAN.

03:35.690 --> 03:37.780
I am Cockatrice.

03:38.230 --> 03:40.280
<i>How does he know my name?</i>

03:40.280 --> 03:44.450
SŌKAIYA grabbed José-SAN a short while ago.

03:45.580 --> 03:47.950
Now then, Nancy-SAN.

03:47.950 --> 03:52.040
Tell me what you're doing here!

03:52.960 --> 03:55.290
DŌMO, Cockatrice-SAN!

03:55.290 --> 03:57.420
I am NINJA Slayer.

04:00.260 --> 04:03.430
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:03.430 --> 04:05.430
I am Cockatrice.

04:05.430 --> 04:07.470
What are you doing here?

04:07.470 --> 04:08.430
Just passing through.

04:08.720 --> 04:10.810
But I'll still slay you.

04:10.810 --> 04:11.930
BITE!

04:11.930 --> 04:13.020
YEEART!

04:15.650 --> 04:19.530
You are indeed as good as they say, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:19.860 --> 04:23.650
But your luck ran out when you met me!

04:24.410 --> 04:25.740
Inconceivable!

04:26.490 --> 04:27.950
Where his arms should be,

04:28.700 --> 04:31.620
there are instead live snakes!

04:31.620 --> 04:32.660
How terrifying!

04:32.660 --> 04:37.790
Only those whose NINJA Souls are strong enough to endure Lee-SENSEI's surgery

04:37.790 --> 04:40.420
can master the DAIJA BITE!

04:37.790 --> 04:40.420
NOTE: DAIJA means GIANT NINJA SNAKES.

04:40.420 --> 04:43.090
In other words, I'm the only one who can!

04:43.090 --> 04:47.090
Is it a SŌKAIYA rule that one's introduction must be of tedious length?

04:43.090 --> 04:47.090
NOTE: Yes.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.890
Come, Cockatrice-SAN!

04:49.890 --> 04:52.270
CHOMP! BITE!

04:52.890 --> 04:54.730
CONSTRICT!

04:55.390 --> 04:57.520
Well? Can't move, can you?

04:57.520 --> 05:00.020
This is how I always win.

05:00.360 --> 05:03.780
You're going to be eaten alive!

05:03.780 --> 05:05.280
WASSHOI!

05:05.950 --> 05:07.910
GWAAAAGGGGH!

05:08.950 --> 05:09.990
GWAGH!

05:10.240 --> 05:11.370
GWAGGH...

05:11.830 --> 05:13.200
GWUUHAGGH!

05:13.660 --> 05:15.710
GWUHAAAGGGH!

05:20.880 --> 05:24.720
This makes things much simpler, doesn't it, Cockatrice?

05:26.180 --> 05:29.510
Have this Lee-SENSEI of yours fix your arms.

05:29.510 --> 05:31.600
Go ahead and wait for him

05:32.010 --> 05:33.350
in JIGOKU!

05:32.010 --> 05:33.350
NOTE: JIGOKU is NINJA HELL.

05:33.350 --> 05:34.600
YEEART!

05:34.600 --> 05:36.140
SAYŌNARA!

05:53.620 --> 05:56.660
Wh-Who are you?

05:56.660 --> 05:59.580
It hasn't been long since you were bitten.

05:59.580 --> 06:02.920
You should be able to move soon.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.630
What's going to happen?

06:04.630 --> 06:06.090
Who killed Taragi Wei?

06:06.090 --> 06:06.720
Why did yo—

06:06.720 --> 06:08.470
I am NINJA Slayer.

06:09.050 --> 06:12.100
Nancy-SAN, give up on playing detective,

06:12.100 --> 06:13.930
and seek asylum in KYŌTO or elsewhere.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.770
Do not underestimate the Syndicate.

06:16.770 --> 06:18.140
They are not to be trifled with.

06:18.690 --> 06:19.730
Answer my ques—

06:22.320 --> 06:23.440
Damn it!

06:30.660 --> 06:31.870
TANUKI

06:35.870 --> 06:39.960
If I can figure out what that means, I should be able to find the truth.

06:41.630 --> 06:44.090
And when I do, I'm sure I'll find him.

06:52.720 --> 06:56.520
ZAZEN AND NINJA

07:49.280 --> 07:50.400
DŌMO.

07:51.280 --> 07:52.490
YEEART!

07:52.490 --> 07:53.410
DŌMO.

07:53.410 --> 07:55.280
I am NINJA Slayer.

08:00.450 --> 08:04.130
Your name is NINJA Slayer-san?

08:04.670 --> 08:07.750
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-san.

08:07.750 --> 08:11.720
My name is Sugawarano Tomihide.

08:11.720 --> 08:15.260
Sugawarano-SAN, I have a request to make.

08:15.640 --> 08:19.020
I want you to forget that you saw me here.

08:19.720 --> 08:22.640
A crow is not a BUDDHA.

08:19.720 --> 08:22.640
NOTE: This is a profound ZEN CONE.

08:23.560 --> 08:27.400
I see. So you were watching me from behind?

08:27.400 --> 08:31.070
Don't worry, I won't contact the authorities.

08:31.070 --> 08:33.650
You are not a bad person.

08:33.650 --> 08:35.360
Even in this age of MAPPŌ,

08:33.650 --> 08:35.360
NOTE: In MAPPŌ, BUDDHA fucks off.

08:35.360 --> 08:41.330
you are the kind of man who would take a hook out of the beak of a filthy crow.

08:41.330 --> 08:42.410
DŌMO.

08:45.620 --> 08:50.000
You aren't afraid even though there's a NINJA sitting next to you?

08:50.000 --> 08:55.430
When you're my age, not much surprises you anymore.

08:56.260 --> 09:01.430
And I knew that you were not a bad person.

09:01.430 --> 09:04.020
Oh, look at this.

09:04.020 --> 09:06.190
This is my family.

09:06.190 --> 09:09.520
This was the time of my life when I was most happy.

09:09.520 --> 09:14.110
My wife died soon after, and my son left home.

09:14.780 --> 09:19.120
You're not in touch with your son at all anymore?

09:20.240 --> 09:24.410
Actually, after my son failed his CENTER exams,

09:24.410 --> 09:27.630
he left home, saying he was going to the KYŌTO REPUBLIC.

09:27.630 --> 09:30.130
For several years, I heard nothing from him.

09:30.630 --> 09:31.920
But afterwards,

09:31.920 --> 09:37.470
he called and said he was working at MURASAKI SHIKIBU Cosmetics.

09:37.470 --> 09:39.800
MURASAKI SHIKIBU Cosmetics?

09:39.800 --> 09:42.060
That's a KACHIGUMI Corporation!

09:39.800 --> 09:42.060
NOTE: The KACHIGUMI are better than you.

09:42.430 --> 09:45.180
Yes, so I've heard.

09:45.180 --> 09:50.900
Ever since, every so often,
I'll get a deposit in my account.

09:50.900 --> 09:52.530
You have a good son.

09:53.610 --> 09:55.570
To tell the truth,

09:55.570 --> 10:00.070
sometimes I think I'd rather be with my son than have the money.

10:00.660 --> 10:04.750
But I don't want to interfere with his work.

10:04.750 --> 10:07.210
So, I gave up.

10:11.210 --> 10:13.710
Why are you so calm and peaceful?

10:13.710 --> 10:16.090
You have not a trace of murderous intent.

10:16.090 --> 10:19.220
Could you be a master of CHADŌ?

10:16.090 --> 10:19.220
NOTE: Tea + ZEN = CHADŌ.

10:21.680 --> 10:25.720
CHADŌ is much too fancy a hobby for me.

10:25.720 --> 10:28.640
I don't even own a single teapot.

10:28.640 --> 10:32.270
My mistake, then.

10:34.150 --> 10:36.280
Now then, Sugawarano-SAN.

10:36.780 --> 10:39.030
This time it is truly goodbye.

10:39.410 --> 10:41.410
NINJA Slayer-san.

10:41.410 --> 10:46.330
Are you always on the roof at this time of day?

10:46.750 --> 10:47.660
No.

10:48.620 --> 10:50.790
Farewell, then!

10:51.040 --> 10:52.840
Farewell.
